  "title": "Rank and normal form of a matrix",
  "summary": "Rank interpretation; normal/canonical form; row and column transformations; two normal-form rank reductions.",
  "transcription_policy": "Notebook wording is preserved as written as far as it is safely readable. Overwritten matrix entries are not guessed; the clean cumulative unit box keeps the readable transformation sequence and final result.",
  "mapped_topics": [
    {
      "topic_id": "u1-rank-echelon",
